#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Xwayland"
msgstr "Instalação do Xwayland"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>xwayland</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>xwayland</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/install_man/,$d' meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..              \\\n"
"      --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release   \\\n"
"      -D xkb_output_dir=/var/lib/xkb &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/install_man/,$d' meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..              \\\n"
"      --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release   \\\n"
"      -D xkb_output_dir=/var/lib/xkb &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#.  keep 22.1 above: they used to build it in gitlab-ci because debian
#.      had an obsolete version of weston, but now they take weston from
#.      debian so the command to build it has been removed.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Building the test framework needs some work. First, <ulink "
"url=\"https://wayland.pages.freedesktop.org/weston/\">weston</ulink> brings "
"in several dependencies, but the number can be reduced by disabling unneeded"
" features. The <command>meson</command> command for a stripped down build of"
" <application>weston</application> is shown in <ulink "
"url=\"https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/xserver/-/blob/xwayland-22.1/.gitlab-"
"ci/debian-install.sh\"> Upstream continuous integration build</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Construir a estrutura de teste precisa de algum trabalho. Primeiro, <ulink "
"url=\"https://wayland.pages.freedesktop.org/weston/\">weston</ulink> traz "
"várias dependências, mas o número pode ser reduzido desabilitando recursos "
"desnecessários. O comando <command>meson</command> para uma construção "
"simplificada do <application>weston</application> é mostrado em <ulink "
"url=\"https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/xserver/-/blob/xwayland-22.1/.gitlab-"
"ci/debian-install.sh\"> construção da integração contínua do(a) "
"desenvolvedor(a)</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Running the tests involves downloading two other frameworks, in addition to "
"the mentioned optional dependencies:"
msgstr ""
"Executar os testes envolve transferir outras duas estruturas, em adição às "
"mencionadas dependências opcionais:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:153
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir tools &amp;&amp;\n"
"pushd tools &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"git clone https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/piglit.git --depth 1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; piglit/piglit.conf &lt;&lt; EOF                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal>[xts]\n"
"path=$(pwd)/xts\n"
"EOF</literal>\n"
"\n"
"git clone https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/test/xts --depth 1   &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"export DISPLAY=:22           &amp;&amp;\n"
"../hw/vfb/Xvfb $DISPLAY &amp;\n"
"VFB_PID=$!                   &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd xts                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"CFLAGS=-fcommon ./autogen.sh &amp;&amp;\n"
"make                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"kill $VFB_PID                &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset DISPLAY VFB_PID        &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir tools &amp;&amp;\n"
"pushd tools &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"git clone https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/piglit.git --depth 1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; piglit/piglit.conf &lt;&lt; EOF                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal>[xts]\n"
"path=$(pwd)/xts\n"
"EOF</literal>\n"
"\n"
"git clone https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/test/xts --depth 1   &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"export DISPLAY=:22           &amp;&amp;\n"
"../hw/vfb/Xvfb $DISPLAY &amp;\n"
"VFB_PID=$!                   &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd xts                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"CFLAGS=-fcommon ./autogen.sh &amp;&amp;\n"
"make                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"kill $VFB_PID                &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset DISPLAY VFB_PID        &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid "Then the tests can be run with:"
msgstr "Então os testes podem ser executados com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:178
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>XTEST_DIR=$(pwd)/tools/xts PIGLIT_DIR=$(pwd)/tools/piglit ninja "
"test</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>XTEST_DIR=$(pwd)/tools/xts PIGLIT_DIR=$(pwd)/tools/piglit ninja "
"test</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:185
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sysconfig/createfiles &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>/tmp/.X11-unix dir 1777 root root</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sysconfig/createfiles &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>/tmp/.X11-unix dir 1777 root root</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:190
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:193
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref role='nodep' linkend='xorg-server'/> is not installed and you do "
"not plan to install it later, you can install <command>Xvfb</command> from "
"this package. As the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se o <xref role='nodep' linkend='xorg-server'/> não estiver instalado e você"
" não planeja instalá-lo mais tarde, você pode instalar o "
"<command>Xvfb</command> a partir deste pacote. Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:198
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>install -vm755 hw/vfb/Xvfb /usr/bin</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>install -vm755 hw/vfb/Xvfb /usr/bin</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i '/install_man/,$d' meson.build</command>: Prevents "
"installing a manual page for <command>Xserver</command>, which is also "
"provided by <xref linkend='xorg-server'/>.  Remove this command if <xref "
"linkend='xorg-server'/> is not installed and you don't plan to install it "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i '/install_man/,$d' meson.build</command>: Impede a "
"instalação de uma página de manual para o "
"&quot;<command>Xserver</command>&quot;, que também é fornecida pelo "
"&quot;<xref linkend='xorg-server'/>&quot;. Remova esse comando se o "
"&quot;<xref linkend='xorg-server'/>&quot; não estiver instalado e você não "
"planejar instalá-lo mais tarde."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D secure-rpc=false</option>: This option disables building RPC "
"support if <xref linkend=\"libtirpc\"/> is not installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D secure-rpc=false</option>: Essa opção desabilita construir "
"suporte RPC se <xref linkend=\"libtirpc\"/> não estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/xwayland.xml:222
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sysconfig/createfiles...</command>: This command "
"creates the <filename class=\"directory\">/tmp/.X11-unix</filename> "
"directory at startup, and ensures that the permissions and ownership are "
"correct as required by applications using Xwayland."
msgstr ""
"<command>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sysconfig/createfiles...</command>: Esse comando "
"cria o diretório &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/tmp/.X11-unix</filename>&quot; na inicialização e "
"garante que as permissões e titularidade da propriedade estejam corretas "
"conforme exigido pelos aplicativos que usam o &quot;Xwayland&quot;."

